       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID.    SWI55700.
      ******************************************************************
      *     PROGRAMA SWI55700.                                         *
      *                                                                *
      *     Extractos/Correspondente
      ******************************************************************
      *     LOG ALTERACOES:                                            *
      *   USER     / DATA     /   REFERENCIA / OBSERVACOES             *
